#: games/generated/rulebooks/bridge.rb:18
msgid "A bid consists of a number from 1 to 7 and a suit, or no trump. Add six to the number to find your target: 1 heart promises seven tricks, while 4 spades promises ten. The named suit becomes trumps, whose cards can beat cards of the other suits. A no-trump contract has no such suit."
msgstr "Nabídka obsahuje číslo od 1 do 7 a barvu, případně bez trumfů. K číslu přičtěte šest: 1 srdce slibuje sedm zdvihů, 4 piky deset. Zvolená barva je trumfová, takže její karty mohou přebít ostatní barvy. Při hře bez trumfů tuto výhodu nemá žádná barva."

#: games/generated/rulebooks/bridge.rb:18
msgid "A bid names a number of tricks and a trump suit, or no trump. The number is added to six: a bid of 1 heart promises 7 of the 13 tricks with hearts as trumps, and 4 spades promises 10 tricks with spades as trumps. Each bid must be higher than the previous one. A higher number always wins, and at the same number the suits rank from the lowest: clubs, diamonds, hearts, spades and no trump. After 1 spade you may bid 1 no trump or anything at the level of 2, but not 1 heart."
msgstr ""

msgid "A bidder who collects at least the exact contracted number receives the contract value; otherwise the same value is subtracted. Each defender receives the exact points collected and then rounded to the nearest 5. A rounded result is never used to decide whether the bidder fulfilled the contract."
