msgstr ""

msgid "Every taken card, including a recovered joker, must be returned to the table during this turn or incur 300 penalty points. Returning another physical copy of the same card also settles one debt. Discarding it does not. You may keep it and end the turn: the penalty is applied once and it becomes an ordinary hand card. Timeout and unreturned-card penalties add together."
msgstr ""

