msgid "While connected to a voice conference, Channel space appears directly after the voice conversation button. Use the arrow keys to move, and Shift+Left/Right Arrow to turn, just as in ELTEN conferences."
msgstr "Během hlasového hovoru se hned za jeho tlačítkem zobrazí pole Prostor kanálu. Šipkami se v něm můžete pohybovat a pomocí Shift+šipka vlevo nebo vpravo se otáčet, stejně jako v konferencích ELTENu."

#: games/generated/rulebooks/monopoly.rb:33
msgid "While in debt you may declare bankruptcy. It happens automatically on your own turn when you have no buildings left to sell and no property available to mortgage. A merely possible trade does not postpone this. If another player is your creditor, they receive your remaining properties and held jail cards, with buildings liquidated at half price. For a debt to the bank, the properties return to the bank. Bankruptcy ends your participation; the last player still solvent wins."
msgstr ""

#: games/generated/rulebooks/mahjong.rb:12
msgid "While responding to a tile, D reads the tile to which Pass, Chow, Pung, Kong or Mahjong applies. It does not change or submit your choice. In Solitaire, D still reads coordinates."
msgstr ""

#: games/generated/rulebooks/mahjong.rb:156 games/generated/rulebooks/mahjong.rb:275 games/generated/rulebooks/mahjong.rb:60
msgid "While you browse game fields, a new turn focuses Draw a tile. After drawing, focus moves to the newly drawn tile in your hand, marked just drawn. This does not discard it. You can move to another tile with the arrows or keep the new tile and discard an old one."
msgstr ""

